  (text "1 Charger: BQ25798, internal pack" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 3.81 3.81) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "70b0cb5e-c9d7-5a83-8cc3-5f30b5fc4ab3"))
  (text "A separate board on the power board's charger port: J21 (XT30) DOCK_VIN in, J22 (XT30) to the pack (PACK_F," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "726f8ef1-352b-5ed1-a445-019ba4018bd7"))
  (text "after the pack fuse on the power board), J23 (JST-GH 6) I2C, INT and supplies. Pull-ups are on the power board." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 49.53 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "73c108ea-1a2c-5cb8-ae37-b46da287e6de"))
  (text "BQ25798RQM: 750 kHz, 4S defaults (PROG 27.0k), so L1 = 2.2 uH (saturation >= 7 A). Datasheet SLUSDV2C." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cd74e079-85fe-5eea-9440-fe0ef2d37d96"))
  (text "One input straight to VBUS with no ACFET-RBFETs (datasheet 7.3.5.2, Figure 8-1): VAC1 and VAC2 tied to VBUS," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 57.15 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d3a7c511-db3e-513f-95f3-f1727f1e23ec"))
  (text "ACDRV1 and ACDRV2 to GND. Compare with Figure 8-1 before layout, including its optional input snubber" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 60.96 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ada12ee1-2576-53cc-b611-9e35cc62dd55"))
  (text "(recommended when hot plugging adapters above 15 V). Never enable OTG: it would drive VBUS." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 64.77 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "38c72099-7cf6-5c42-9d93-67ac96522acb"))
  (text "SYS powers nothing (the base's 5 V comes from the power board's LIGHT_BUS); it keeps its capacitors." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 68.58 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2347afd0-3ab8-5b49-acb9-7ba6ccceb8f9"))
  (text "ILIM_HIZ divider 10k/10.7k from REGN: 2.59 V = a 2.0 A input clamp at power-up (VILIM = 1 V + 0.8 Ohm x ILIM)," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 72.39 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f0d267b6-a5d8-5eb2-a920-634501f3a7bb"))
  (text "so lights (~7 A) plus charging stay under a VB99 D-Tap's 10 A with no firmware. The base can lift it by clearing" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 76.2 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c2114b6d-c558-59cc-a412-29bbb4bb3431"))
  (text "EN_EXTILIM and writing IINDPM (datasheet 7.3.4.3)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 80.01 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1b1b5ee4-b9c8-50df-a922-acf4283aab95"))
  (text "TS: 5.23k / 30.1k divider from REGN with a 103AT 10k NTC on the cells (J4; 0 to 60 C window)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 83.82 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2057751b-1fec-58bc-8e3c-b880d82d3660"))
  (text "No ship FET (the pack's own BMS protects it): SDRV gets 1 nF to GND. QON left to its internal pull-up (test point)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 87.63 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f49050ff-f4e1-5699-8b41-8caf26c71d9d"))
  (text "D+/D- not connected (no USB input); disable AUTO_INDET in firmware." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 91.44 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "69bd2fb3-9c1c-55e9-a230-c8bf1383feed"))
  (wire (pts (xy 1076.96 123.19) (xy 1071.88 123.19)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "14efd03a-d26d-5522-a975-736fbd886f1e"))
